  "description": "GC Milano is a modern, bold serif typeface that blends timeless elegance with striking strength. Designed to stand out while remaining refined, it’s perfectly suited for headlines, branding, logos, packaging, editorial layouts, and luxury-inspired visuals. Crafted with precision, it delivers a confident and sophisticated impression in any design.\nWith its high-contrast strokes, sharp serifs, and sculpted curves, GC Milano combines power with elegance. Whether you’re creating fashion identities, editorial spreads, or artistic projects, this typeface brings versatility, clarity, and refined style to your work.\nMake your design bold, refined, and timeless with the GC Milano font.\nGC Milano font is PUA-encoded, allowing effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>GC Milano is a modern, bold serif typeface</strong> that blends timeless elegance with striking strength. Designed to stand out while remaining refined, it’s perfectly suited for headlines, branding, logos, packaging, editorial layouts, and luxury-inspired visuals. Crafted with precision, it delivers a confident and sophisticated impression in any design.</p>\n<p>With its high-contrast strokes, sharp serifs, and sculpted curves, GC Milano combines power with elegance. Whether you’re creating fashion identities, editorial spreads, or artistic projects, this typeface brings versatility, clarity, and refined style to your work.</p>\n<p>Make your design bold, refined, and timeless with the&nbsp;<strong>GC Milano font.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>GC Milano font is PUA-encoded, allowing effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters.</strong></p>",
